WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.520
This show contains scenes that some viewers may
find disturbing. Viewer discretion is advised.

00:00:01.380 --> 00:00:05.670
<i>Until now, I have never trusted
anyone who was not an elf.</i>

00:00:06.470 --> 00:00:07.250
<i>But...</i>

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:10.940
Arc.

00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:15.650
Would I be able to hire you right now?

00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:18.280
You wish to hire me?

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:19.070
Yes.

00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:27.370
But wouldn't your comrades
have concerns about my presence?

00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:30.560
I imagine some won't be pleased...

00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:34.120
And if you were any other
human, I wouldn't risk it.

00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:39.700
But you show no prejudice against elves,

00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:41.810
and you saved those children.

00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:44.760
Even a spirit creature has accepted you.

00:00:45.890 --> 00:00:49.000
So I will trust you.

00:00:49.810 --> 00:00:54.480
I ask you to lend me your
help in saving my people.

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:02.280
Very well.

00:01:03.950 --> 00:01:07.500
You have my services
as a mercenary, Lady Ariane.

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:11.650
Thank you, Arc.

00:02:47.180 --> 00:02:49.440
<b>Gate</b>

00:02:49.710 --> 00:02:51.850
<i>Hi there. It's me, Arc.</i>

00:02:52.360 --> 00:02:54.790
<i>Living a low-key, inconspicuous life...</i>

00:02:54.790 --> 00:02:58.220
<i>It seems that encountering Lady Ariane</i>

00:02:58.220 --> 00:03:00.350
<i>might be making me reconsider
that agenda of mine.</i>

00:03:03.840 --> 00:03:09.040
Unbelievable...
this is the Lydel River, right?

00:03:10.240 --> 00:03:13.120
Which would make
that Diento in the distance.

00:03:13.120 --> 00:03:13.960
Indeed.

00:03:14.800 --> 00:03:17.730
It'd be troublesome
to cause a commotion in town.

00:03:18.270 --> 00:03:20.840
I transported us to a place
within walking distance.

00:03:20.840 --> 00:03:22.520
This is remarkable.

00:03:22.520 --> 00:03:26.320
To be able to use teleportation magic
without an incantation...

00:03:26.320 --> 00:03:28.560
Does it seem like I'll be of some help?

00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:30.640
Yes. Of course.

00:03:30.640 --> 00:03:33.400
I can't think of a better power
to help save my kin.

00:03:35.820 --> 00:03:38.630
Now then, we should make our way there
before the sun begins to set.

00:03:39.240 --> 00:03:41.920
We're meeting another elf in the town, yes?

00:03:41.920 --> 00:03:42.720
Right.

00:03:43.990 --> 00:03:47.410
Diento

00:03:52.580 --> 00:03:55.220
What is the plan now?

00:03:55.770 --> 00:03:59.720
We're meeting a comrade of mine, Danka.

00:04:00.360 --> 00:04:01.550
So soon?

00:04:03.110 --> 00:04:07.490
<i>Since Ariane's a beautiful elf warrior...</i>

00:04:07.490 --> 00:04:10.260
<i>I wonder what Danka's like.</i>

00:04:11.620 --> 00:04:12.540
Ariane.

00:04:13.220 --> 00:04:13.890
There he is.

00:04:18.160 --> 00:04:21.920
Wh-Whoa! That is one severe-looking elf!

00:04:22.870 --> 00:04:24.560
I'm sorry about the wait, Ariane.

00:04:24.560 --> 00:04:28.240
It's all right, Danka, we just arrived.

00:04:29.150 --> 00:04:30.990
Then this is Danka?

00:04:31.310 --> 00:04:34.400
Now, who exactly is this?

00:04:34.400 --> 00:04:35.860
This is Arc.

00:04:35.860 --> 00:04:38.210
A mercenary who will be helping us.

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:39.790
A mercenary...?

00:04:43.170 --> 00:04:45.270
I'd hate to draw attention
out in the street.

00:04:45.270 --> 00:04:47.080
Let's discuss this elsewhere.

00:04:48.520 --> 00:04:49.830
Good idea.

00:04:58.740 --> 00:05:00.270
Here you are!

00:05:00.280 --> 00:05:01.160
It's been a while!

00:05:01.160 --> 00:05:02.160
Tell me about it.

00:05:02.160 --> 00:05:03.490
I'd say two years, right?

00:05:03.490 --> 00:05:07.190
Are you sure you're not hungry, Arc?

00:05:07.190 --> 00:05:09.450
Yes. I'm quite fine.

00:05:10.040 --> 00:05:13.410
<i>There is no way I'm taking this helm off.</i>

00:05:13.410 --> 00:05:15.640
<i>They'd be all over me the second I did!</i>

00:05:15.640 --> 00:05:16.210
Say your prayers!

00:05:16.210 --> 00:05:16.870
Don't hurt me!

00:05:17.600 --> 00:05:20.210
This is Danka Niel Maple.

00:05:20.210 --> 00:05:25.700
He's an elf warrior like myself,
and has been gathering information.

00:05:26.190 --> 00:05:27.380
Maple?

00:05:27.880 --> 00:05:30.980
You gave that as your name, as well.

00:05:30.980 --> 00:05:31.680
Yes.

00:05:31.680 --> 00:05:33.710
Are you siblings, or...?

00:05:33.710 --> 00:05:34.720
No.

00:05:35.270 --> 00:05:38.680
Elvish names consist of our given name,

00:05:38.680 --> 00:05:42.790
the name of our parent of the same gender,
and the village we are from.

00:05:42.790 --> 00:05:44.500
That's where the individual parts are from.

00:05:45.520 --> 00:05:49.160
It means that we're both
citizens of the city of Maple,

00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:52.670
from within the Great Canada Forest.

00:05:52.670 --> 00:05:55.290
I don't see the point in explaining this.

00:05:55.290 --> 00:05:58.990
In that case, Sir Danka, what matters
have you been looking into...?

00:05:58.990 --> 00:06:02.400
Goa beef skewers, a Diento delicacy.

00:06:02.820 --> 00:06:08.140
They have a flavor unique to this town,
where they're raised as livestock.

00:06:10.760 --> 00:06:12.000
Stonewalled!

00:06:12.690 --> 00:06:13.790
And to accompany it,

00:06:13.800 --> 00:06:17.700
something only made possible
by the verdant fields in the vicinity,

00:06:17.700 --> 00:06:21.520
honey beer made from only
the finest grade of honey.

00:06:28.910 --> 00:06:30.080
Impressive.

00:06:30.910 --> 00:06:32.480
So, what exactly is this?

00:06:32.480 --> 00:06:34.320
What am I, an object?!

00:06:34.320 --> 00:06:35.860
This is Arc.

00:06:35.860 --> 00:06:40.370
A mercenary who came to my aid when I
was fighting the elf hunters in the forest.

00:06:40.370 --> 00:06:44.290
I hired him in order
to help us with the rescue.

00:06:46.540 --> 00:06:47.760
Did you, now?

00:06:48.560 --> 00:06:51.380
He's no ordinary mercenary.

00:06:51.380 --> 00:06:53.430
He can use teleportation magic.

00:06:53.430 --> 00:06:56.390
Teleportation? You're sure?

00:06:57.640 --> 00:06:59.640
There are limitations, but yes.

00:07:00.860 --> 00:07:02.930
A ventu vulpis?

00:07:02.930 --> 00:07:06.530
This is Ponta. Arc's companion.

00:07:10.980 --> 00:07:14.430
Someone who can use teleportation,
and who has a spirit creature as company...

00:07:14.920 --> 00:07:17.050
That does sound like it will come in handy.

00:07:19.240 --> 00:07:23.130
So, have you been able to
locate their base of operations?

00:07:23.490 --> 00:07:24.220
I have.

00:07:25.580 --> 00:07:27.850
It's located near
the entertainment district.

00:07:28.670 --> 00:07:31.170
We'll find the missing elves there.

00:07:36.380 --> 00:07:40.850
But even after nightfall,
it's still fairly active.

00:07:41.240 --> 00:07:45.920
We'll need to wait until late at night,
once there are fewer people around.

00:07:45.920 --> 00:07:46.970
Right.

00:07:46.970 --> 00:07:48.990
So we'll be waiting here until then.

00:07:51.120 --> 00:07:54.000
We won't be taking action
for some time, then?

00:07:57.670 --> 00:07:59.790
I'll be gone for an hour.

00:08:00.500 --> 00:08:03.080
I have some errands to attend to.

00:08:03.080 --> 00:08:05.480
All right. We'll be waiting.

00:08:08.920 --> 00:08:10.430
Come along, Ponta.

00:08:18.190 --> 00:08:19.820
I'm surprised.

00:08:19.820 --> 00:08:21.250
About what?

00:08:22.160 --> 00:08:24.970
That you'd rely on an outsider.

00:08:29.480 --> 00:08:32.230
In the battle, before we came here...

00:08:32.230 --> 00:08:37.630
if it weren't for his help,
I might have been captured.

00:08:37.630 --> 00:08:40.000
Did you underestimate your foes?

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:42.600
Or was it impatience?

00:08:43.480 --> 00:08:45.690
I've failed as a warrior...

00:08:46.190 --> 00:08:49.080
I know my sister would have managed.

00:08:49.080 --> 00:08:50.250
True.

00:08:50.250 --> 00:08:53.600
Eevin would've likely won
without much difficulty.

00:08:54.550 --> 00:08:57.260
But there's no point
in making the comparison.

00:08:58.140 --> 00:09:01.130
For how young you are,
you've acquitted yourself admirably.

00:09:01.130 --> 00:09:05.000
With experience,
you'll one day stand as her equal.

00:09:05.760 --> 00:09:06.720
Right.

00:09:09.040 --> 00:09:10.390
More importantly, Ariane...

00:09:11.060 --> 00:09:14.780
Can we really trust this man?

00:09:17.250 --> 00:09:17.960
Yes.

00:09:18.740 --> 00:09:22.060
I see. Then I'll leave it at that.

00:09:26.160 --> 00:09:29.420
I'm glad the stuff I took off those
bandits made for a nice profit!

00:09:30.300 --> 00:09:32.390
Now, then...

00:09:33.030 --> 00:09:34.900
First things first.

00:09:35.830 --> 00:09:37.200
Okay!

00:09:47.980 --> 00:09:49.800
Goa beef skewers!

00:09:50.850 --> 00:09:52.940
Salt-grilled rainbow sword-trout!

00:09:53.920 --> 00:09:55.920
Seasonal fruit pizza!

00:09:56.880 --> 00:10:00.240
And the Diento specialty, honey beer!

00:10:01.490 --> 00:10:02.970
Time to eat!

00:10:12.260 --> 00:10:13.440
So good...

00:10:13.880 --> 00:10:17.730
Delicious! I can feel
the flavor in my bones!

00:10:19.780 --> 00:10:22.100
It's gonna be a long night...

00:10:22.100 --> 00:10:24.750
Better eat while we can!

00:10:37.370 --> 00:10:39.730
We've got word on when to send them out.

00:10:39.730 --> 00:10:41.480
First thing tomorrow morning.

00:10:42.520 --> 00:10:45.330
Gonna be easy living for a while
once this job's taken care of.

00:10:50.360 --> 00:10:52.870
I know one of our warriors will save us!

00:10:52.870 --> 00:10:55.330
And then you'll all die!

00:10:58.790 --> 00:11:01.050
Well, ain't that a scary thought?

00:11:03.130 --> 00:11:03.760
Get over here!

00:11:10.810 --> 00:11:13.870
It's okay! Someone will help us!

00:11:24.840 --> 00:11:27.480
All right. Let's go.

00:11:40.440 --> 00:11:41.510
That's the place.

00:11:44.070 --> 00:11:46.380
No shortage of guards,
even at the rear entrance...

00:11:46.380 --> 00:11:49.280
I doubt they're bone-idle enough
to sneak past, either.

00:11:49.280 --> 00:11:51.190
Yes, they're not bone-idle.

00:11:51.810 --> 00:11:52.650
Bone...?!

00:11:52.650 --> 00:11:55.980
W-Well, I'd say we still
have a bone to pick with them.

00:11:57.050 --> 00:12:02.100
True. It's only a question of how
quickly they realize we're here.

00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:07.420
Once the elves are free,
any enemies we encounter will die.

00:12:09.160 --> 00:12:10.420
I'm curious, Arc...

00:12:11.570 --> 00:12:14.580
Would you be able to
teleport us to that window?

00:12:15.360 --> 00:12:16.550
It should prove no problem.

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:19.920
Let's get further away first.

00:12:19.920 --> 00:12:22.970
The light from the magic
circle would alert them.

00:12:22.970 --> 00:12:25.300
No. There's no need for concern there.

00:12:26.470 --> 00:12:28.520
Place your hands upon me.

00:12:39.560 --> 00:12:41.260
Short-range teleportation magic!

00:12:41.990 --> 00:12:43.820
What in the world are you?

00:12:44.860 --> 00:12:46.300
Just a mercenary.

00:12:47.220 --> 00:12:49.580
That was honestly impressive.

00:12:56.060 --> 00:12:57.770
There's no one inside.

00:12:57.770 --> 00:12:59.770
We should be able to sneak in through here.

00:12:59.770 --> 00:13:00.780
Be careful.

00:13:01.210 --> 00:13:01.810
Right.

00:13:12.520 --> 00:13:14.100
So... tight!

00:13:15.440 --> 00:13:17.540
Almost... there...

00:13:20.080 --> 00:13:21.760
Ow...

00:13:27.600 --> 00:13:30.260
You could have told me that was an option!

00:13:30.260 --> 00:13:33.500
You needn't worry. We looked away.

00:13:36.560 --> 00:13:38.340
You need to erase the memory, too!

00:13:39.550 --> 00:13:42.360
There's no need to feel embarrassed
about your figure giving you trouble...

00:13:41.440 --> 00:13:42.360
Let's move.

00:14:02.770 --> 00:14:04.730
Danka, is this...?

00:14:05.280 --> 00:14:07.200
A single blow to the throat
for every one of them.

00:14:07.200 --> 00:14:08.740
The blood hasn't even dried.

00:14:09.420 --> 00:14:11.780
It hasn't been long, then.

00:14:12.940 --> 00:14:16.130
Someone else has made their way in here.

00:14:16.130 --> 00:14:19.000
I'm not sure what's going on,

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:21.850
but we should find
the others as soon as we can.

00:14:22.610 --> 00:14:25.080
Let's split up and continue the search.

00:14:25.580 --> 00:14:26.680
Be careful.

00:14:33.010 --> 00:14:38.020
Episode 4

00:14:33.010 --> 00:14:38.020
Infiltrating the Slave Market! In Search of the World's Evil

00:14:46.430 --> 00:14:48.980
That makes the sound
of my footfalls a non-issue.

00:14:53.110 --> 00:14:55.160
How about a keyhole...? There it is.

00:15:07.100 --> 00:15:09.480
Again? Who could be doingвЂ”

00:15:13.880 --> 00:15:15.220
Were the kunai just a distraction?!

00:15:25.060 --> 00:15:26.480
A ninja?!

00:15:26.480 --> 00:15:28.490
<i>And on top of that...</i>

00:15:31.150 --> 00:15:34.670
A furry-eared ninja! Here we go!

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:40.120
How is it that you know what a ninja is?

00:15:41.870 --> 00:15:46.280
<i>I dunno what to say except that
she is very, very obviously a ninja!</i>

00:15:47.120 --> 00:15:49.300
You are no ordinary intruder.

00:15:52.560 --> 00:15:54.530
I beg your pardon.

00:15:54.530 --> 00:15:57.040
If you are in the company
of a spirit creature,

00:15:57.040 --> 00:16:01.270
then I doubt you could
be acting maliciously.

00:16:02.160 --> 00:16:04.200
<i>I don't know why, exactly,</i>

00:16:04.200 --> 00:16:06.200
<i>but I think she realizes
it was a misunderstanding.</i>

00:16:07.420 --> 00:16:12.180
I assume you're here
to free the captive elves?

00:16:12.180 --> 00:16:13.750
Wait, is that what you're after, as well?

00:16:13.750 --> 00:16:14.600
No.

00:16:15.220 --> 00:16:17.880
I couldn't find what I was looking for.

00:16:19.020 --> 00:16:21.920
You'll find the elves
imprisoned underground.

00:16:22.680 --> 00:16:23.740
What's this?

00:16:24.270 --> 00:16:27.100
Something that I believe will be
of use to you and your allies.

00:16:42.920 --> 00:16:43.900
Right...

00:16:44.300 --> 00:16:46.200
one other matter,
to make up for attacking you.

00:16:46.700 --> 00:16:50.780
There are two elves being held
captive in the lord's manor, as well.

00:16:50.780 --> 00:16:51.540
What?!

00:16:51.540 --> 00:16:53.080
We'll meet again, soon.

00:16:53.520 --> 00:16:54.360
Wait!

00:16:57.740 --> 00:17:00.210
Didn't even get a chance to ask her name...

00:17:00.720 --> 00:17:05.110
Still, I had no idea being friends
with spirit creatures was so rare...

00:17:05.870 --> 00:17:08.400
You sure about this arrangement, Ponta?

00:17:11.050 --> 00:17:13.640
She mentioned they would be of use...

00:17:13.640 --> 00:17:15.580
What could these documents be?

00:17:16.740 --> 00:17:17.970
Wait a minute...

00:17:19.460 --> 00:17:21.660
A contract for purchasing elf slaves?

00:17:23.770 --> 00:17:25.540
And this name...

00:17:25.540 --> 00:17:26.790
Right.

00:17:26.790 --> 00:17:30.400
To think the lord of Diento
would be involved, as well...

00:17:30.650 --> 00:17:34.100
The captive elves are being held
in the basement of this manor.

00:17:34.540 --> 00:17:37.860
And there are two more
at the lord's palace.

00:17:38.760 --> 00:17:39.910
Arc...

00:17:39.910 --> 00:17:41.880
between this contract
and that information...

00:17:41.880 --> 00:17:43.620
where is it all coming from?

00:17:44.540 --> 00:17:49.630
<i>I get the feeling bringing up the furry-eared
ninja would just complicate things.</i>

00:17:49.630 --> 00:17:54.610
Well, I simply captured
and questioned one of these villains.

00:17:54.610 --> 00:17:55.830
Impressive.

00:17:56.520 --> 00:18:00.600
So, how do we proceed from here?

00:18:02.250 --> 00:18:04.680
We'll deal with things here
and then head to the palace.

00:18:09.930 --> 00:18:11.670
Who are you people?!

00:18:11.670 --> 00:18:13.570
We've got intruders!

00:18:13.570 --> 00:18:17.980
I doubt we can make it underground
without being noticed now.

00:18:18.280 --> 00:18:20.960
Then we'll simply fight our way there.

00:18:20.960 --> 00:18:22.240
Agreed.

00:18:22.240 --> 00:18:24.750
Don't bother taking them alive!
Just get rid of 'em!

00:18:25.670 --> 00:18:29.330
Fire, I implore you. Light this sword ablaze!

00:18:37.120 --> 00:18:38.480
Let's continue.

00:18:38.480 --> 00:18:40.790
We'll erase each one as we come across them.

00:18:41.640 --> 00:18:42.530
Come on.

00:18:58.880 --> 00:19:01.600
Th-They're too bloody strong!

00:19:01.600 --> 00:19:03.300
What were the upstairs lot doiвЂ”

00:19:07.470 --> 00:19:10.960
Ariane Glenys Maple is here to free you.

00:19:12.130 --> 00:19:13.920
Warriors from Maple!

00:19:14.760 --> 00:19:15.510
Arc?

00:19:20.560 --> 00:19:22.810
It's all right! He's an ally.

00:19:27.890 --> 00:19:29.550
We were so scared!

00:19:30.590 --> 00:19:33.940
It's all right. You're free now.

00:19:33.940 --> 00:19:36.530
Good. We're finished here.

00:19:37.420 --> 00:19:38.380
Arc?

00:19:38.380 --> 00:19:40.370
Understood.

00:19:41.510 --> 00:19:43.480
Let's be on our way. Gate!

00:19:43.200 --> 00:19:44.070
<b>Gate</b>

00:20:02.420 --> 00:20:03.320
Isn't that...?

00:20:08.500 --> 00:20:09.740
Uncurse.

00:20:12.060 --> 00:20:12.920
What?!

00:20:15.590 --> 00:20:16.980
Thank goodness!

00:20:16.980 --> 00:20:21.220
<i>He was able to break
a sealing curse with such ease...</i>

00:20:21.950 --> 00:20:24.160
Just who is he?

00:20:27.640 --> 00:20:29.160
Thank you so much!

00:20:30.190 --> 00:20:31.560
Sir Knight, we're so grateful!

00:20:30.190 --> 00:20:31.560
We're free!

00:20:31.560 --> 00:20:32.880
Thank goodness!

00:20:32.880 --> 00:20:34.130
This is wonderful!

00:20:34.720 --> 00:20:36.090
We can go home now!

00:20:36.990 --> 00:20:38.240
Thank you!

00:20:38.240 --> 00:20:39.480
Thank you!

00:20:40.290 --> 00:20:41.180
What a relief...

00:20:42.420 --> 00:20:45.330
Ariane. This isn't over.

00:20:45.330 --> 00:20:48.300
I'll make sure the children get home safely.

00:20:48.300 --> 00:20:49.660
The rest is in your hands.

00:20:49.660 --> 00:20:50.640
Right.

00:20:50.640 --> 00:20:51.560
Arc...

00:20:52.420 --> 00:20:56.800
The two of you should be able to
rescue the remaining elves.

00:20:58.110 --> 00:21:00.700
Look after Ariane.

00:21:01.520 --> 00:21:02.780
I shall.

00:21:06.240 --> 00:21:08.480
Is that the lord's palace?

00:21:09.330 --> 00:21:10.090
Yes.

00:21:12.260 --> 00:21:13.790
Arc. Please.

00:21:20.380 --> 00:21:22.760
No, it's nothing.

00:21:23.660 --> 00:21:25.500
Then off we go!

00:21:25.850 --> 00:21:27.160
Dimension Move!

00:21:33.920 --> 00:21:36.280
Will they be all right,
with just the two of them?

00:21:36.280 --> 00:21:37.420
Yes.

00:21:37.420 --> 00:21:41.980
Knowing those two, they should
be able to sneak in with ease.

00:21:58.560 --> 00:22:01.640
That knight knew what a ninja was.

00:22:04.020 --> 00:22:07.190
We may meet again.

